# ENTITY-MIB, ENTITY-SENSOR-MIB (RFC 3433) and IF-MIB of a switch with two
# SFP ports (WP-1004). Containment: chassis 1 > port 100 "Te1/0/1"
# (alias ifIndex 12) > transceiver 101 > sensors 102-106; chassis 1 >
# port 200 "Te1/0/2" (alias ifIndex 13) > transceiver 201 > sensors 202,
# 203. Sensor 10 is a chassis temperature (no interface), sensor 300 an
# Rx power sensor without container (unmapped), sensor 203 unavailable.
